# Environment Variables for Student Team Formation Backend

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your actual values.

NEVER commit `.env` to version control.

## Database connection
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=3306
DB_NAME=student_team_formation
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=

## Authentication
# College email domain for student registration (required at startup)
ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAIN=college.edu
# HMAC-SHA256 secret for access tokens; must be at least 32 bytes (required at startup)
JWT_SECRET=

## Email / verification
# SMTP settings for verification emails (use Mailpit in development)
MAIL_HOST=localhost
MAIL_PORT=1025
MAIL_FROM=no-reply@college.edu
MAIL_USERNAME=
MAIL_PASSWORD=
MAIL_SMTP_AUTH=false
MAIL_SMTP_STARTTLS=false
# Base URL used to build verification links
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8081

## Admin bootstrap (optional)
# If no ADMIN account exists and both values are set, one will be created at startup
ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

